# Photography Site

- Hebrew RTL portfolio for Rut Getsel Photography
- Deploy: push `main` → GitHub Actions → `gh-pages` at `/PhotographySite/`
- Images live in `pics/`; paths via `src/utils/images.js` with URL encoding
- Pink/cream section backgrounds use `bg-brand-price-bg` (#f2f0ed from price list), not `bg-brand-antique-pink`
- Gallery marquee: never `loading="lazy"` on animated rows
- Web3Forms key is in `Contact.jsx`; do not require `.env` for production
- Commit and push when user asks; never commit `.env` or secrets
